{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17777","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 四 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉漏飘青璅，金铺丽紫宸。\n云山九门曙，天地一家春。\n瑞霭方呈赏，暄风本配仁。\n岩廊开凤翼，水殿压鳌身。\n文雅逢明代，欢娱及贱臣。\n年年未央阙，恩共物华新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}